    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Heap - k-way merge</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/merge-k-sorted-lists/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 23</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Merge k Sorted Lists</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The next output node is always one of the k current heads, so keep only the heads in a min-heap: pop the smallest, push its successor. O(N log k) time, O(k) extra space.</p>\n"
